+    # stock heaps. Values (MNG-tested): display 80/112 MiB, GPU 192/448 MiB, memory 3632/4080 MiB,
+    # RootHeap 3600/4048 MiB. cbz/tbz never touch the flags and the scratch register is each site's own
+    # destination, so no guest state leaks into the check. x16-free: ADRP targets the destination itself.
